// bubbler profile: vesktop
//
// ~/Downloads is what an attachment is dragged out to or saved into;
// flathub grants the same directory for exactly that. Pictures and
// Videos stay out — sending a file is the portal file chooser's job.
//
// Extra Electron flags go in the private home's vesktop-flags.conf,
// which /usr/bin/vesktop reads from $XDG_CONFIG_HOME. That wrapper also
// sets ELECTRON_OZONE_PLATFORM_HINT itself, so no `env` node here does.
wayland
dri
pipewire
network
dbus
portals
notify
tray
home-share "Downloads" mode=rw
command "vesktop"
